1613
01:40:16,594 --> 01:40:18,012
Rachel.

1614
01:40:19,723 --> 01:40:21,182
Rachel.

1615
01:40:30,191 --> 01:40:31,526
Ma'am Anne.

1616
01:40:31,651 --> 01:40:32,777
Thank you.

1617
01:40:34,696 --> 01:40:37,323
Ma’am Anne, Ms. Rachel is here.

1618
01:40:37,449 --> 01:40:39,576
