1637
01:42:06,746 --> 01:42:08,164
That’s amazing.

1638
01:42:08,289 --> 01:42:09,290
Twinning!

1639
01:42:10,708 --> 01:42:12,126
And the…

1640
01:42:14,003 --> 01:42:16,047
- Yeah, twinning.
- Yeah.

1641
01:42:28,226 --> 01:42:29,978
You have a…

1642
01:42:32,856 --> 01:42:34,274
Anything left?

1643
01:42:35,066 --> 01:42:36,359
Nice smile.

1644
01:42:39,779 --> 01:42:41,281
